* LT3045-1 Low Dropout Linear Regulator Stage
* 5 V input -> 3.3 V output at 100 mA resistive load
*
* Vout = 100uA (SET pin reference current) x RSET = 100uA x 33k = 3.3V
* Subcircuit pin order: IN OUT SET ILIM EN/UV PG GND
*
******************************************************************

* ---- Input source ----
VIN IN 0 DC 5

* ---- Input capacitor ----
CIN IN 0 10u

* ---- Genuine LT3045-1 regulator (library subcircuit) ----
XU1 IN OUT SET ILIM IN PG 0 LT3045-1

* ---- Output voltage programming resistor (3.3V = 100uA * 33k) ----
RSET SET 0 33k
CSET SET 0 100p

* ---- Current limit programming (max, ~500mA) ----
RILIM ILIM 0 10k

* ---- Power-good pull-up ----
RPG OUT PG 100k

* ---- Output capacitor ----
COUT OUT 0 10u

* ---- 100 mA resistive load (3.3V / 33 ohm) ----
RLOAD OUT 0 33

* ---- Analysis ----
.tran 0 5m 0 5u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 4m TO 5m
.meas TRAN iload AVG I(RLOAD) FROM 4m TO 5m

* ---- Model library ----
.include LT3045-1.sub

.end
